{# Default system prompt template, bundled with the package.

Used when an agent's prompt body is empty and no custom template is
configured. Point the SYSTEM_PROMPT_TEMPLATE environment variable (or
the `template_path` argument of render_system_prompt) at your own
.j2 file to replace it.

Available context variables:
  current_date  Today's date in ISO format, e.g. 2026-11-11.
  date          Alias for current_date.
  agent_name    The agent's name from its config (may be empty).
  ...plus any extra context the caller supplies (e.g. user context).

Variables that are not supplied render as empty strings.
#}
You are {{ agent_name or "a helpful assistant" }}.

Today's date is {{ current_date }}.

Follow the user's instructions, use the tools available to you when
they help, and say plainly when something is outside your scope.
